Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:28:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] docs(multimodal,memory): READMEs, locale metadata,
 catalogs, and gate fixes

- Move read_audio/read_video to the experimental group (they depend on the
  experimental speech seam) and rename them dsh-experimental-tool-read-*.
- Bilingual package and group READMEs with Model Experience, Known
  Limitations, and Dev Note sections; locale metadata in eight languages.
- Register the new tools in the generated tool catalog (en/zh) and
  regenerate config, cordis, client, plugin-package, and graph catalogs.
- Acknowledge the auxiliary message source kinds as a same-version
  persistence change; raise the per-slot client catalog budget by one line.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HKCB8j9Zf27m5tAmJdbkFm
